            "paragraph": "GOCCP derives cloud properties from Level-1 measurements by the Cloud and Aerosol Lidar with Orthogonal Polarization (CALIOP) lidar a two-wavelength lidar operating at wavelengths of 532 nm and 1064 nm, mounted on the CALIPSO satellite.",
